From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leaf Performance experiments <noreply@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Sep 2026 01:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Use timing wheel for Bukkit scheduler queues

Source: Paper PR #13705 by Intybyte <vaan.testwork@gmail.com>.
Fixed head: ac5875b377b33110164003a76bdcb53dd0ee477c
Original project: PaperMC/Paper
License: GPL-3.0-only under Paper contribution terms.

Replace the scheduler priority queues with a 4096-slot timing wheel while
preserving same-tick FIFO ordering, async scheduler management serialization,
and Leaf's level-tick-thread zero-delay deadlock avoidance.
